<description>&lt;p&gt;Libyan officials participated in Operation IRINI meetings in Malta, indicating ongoing engagement with the EU naval mission. Algiers is reported to be undermining the rapprochement between Niger and Khalifa Haftar, reflecting regional diplomatic friction involving Libya. A seafarer was killed in a suspected missile attack on a tanker in the Gulf, a incident linked to maritime security concerns affecting Libyan shipping routes. The conflict still registers low combat intensity, with 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNQW1iNndNcXdOam1DRURFeDl2cExCRk43QXZVX3BUUnRBeWFDa2hTS1AzNnkteGFvUEJrRG5rek1nQlpGRkdMTURyOWFNcDFqc0xQLUpER0o3dElzMUxXSFJQMEwxSlE5ODVPVjZtTkFobHN1cUhMYkVlbHF0LXpRNldTdFhvMEN5SzVpYVJrQ1lSQ2hMWm5INkpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPTlN4Z0NvUnBzSnd0SG9fbUx5Z25Xb19YalJBalpPVHpXZ29BUHJUem9aYTZWZkYwOGZxU1pwRXJvWEMweFhjQ0RIcWcwcHZHdUFIMXRSZHY0ZlZwZXh2bGFvTTJaUTB2OGV4SFdDX3h1YTh0clpIYU1JaWdEMk5LaUVsRlFnbzA2SWhybHR3RGcyemZlZUFj?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOWkZubmhhQUdVZ1llaDU4VFVPby0zaGl0QzM1a1pEU0w5RmxIVDVmSXlfamZmY0g3blVIWmtuUFdPYTZHZHdMUUNQbEtYazlXdGd1Q0owbjNyS0xmQ3lMVjNRcnpQMEFTOV84ejBlNXh6ekxIal93aWV1ZzY3QS0tekFPTnRGdm42ZzNLdEdhUUhhbF9wd3pGaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOeHFvNWNkRWJVOHUyY21FWk9DSndaYmpmbHNsOVZKOEVoVjVNQmpoemNrV1FScnBnalE2YkFDU2ZoczRtak94VGM1dEdoRUw3a2h3akVDbElNSDV5YjB4RldNckY5Zk1oU1pJNk50dnkyU2lWS3FhZjRLOGpKTl9wRFFIUTc5bGszdkFPX01TM21vekozaEJSREJOR0I1UE1ZdHE3dTJLdmpLc29rUHdlNFQtOEVEazhrR0xNNXdybmZsNVhMMWJJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Il Foglio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.go